{"strongs": "H2139", "word": "זַכּוּר", "translit": "zak.kur", "root": "זכור", "morph": "N:N-M-P", "pos": "proper name, masculine", "gloss": "Zaccur", "definition": "זַכּוּר proper name, masculine ᵐ5 Ζακχυρ , Ζακχουρ , etc.: — 1. a Reubenite Num 13:4 ( P ). 2. a Simeonite 1Chr 4:26 . 3. Levites: \\ \\ a. 1Chr 24:27 . \\ \\ b. an Asaphite 1Chr 25:2 ( Σακχους ), v 1Chr 25:10 ( Ζαχχουθ ), Neh 12:35 ( Ζακχουρ ), compare זִכְרִי above 3 c. c. Neh 10:13 compare Neh 13:13 4. companion of Ezra, Ezra 8:14 Qr ( Kt זבוד , compare above). 5. contemporary of Nehemiah, Neh 3:2 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2361')\">BDB2361</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H2139')\">H2139</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2360')\">BDB2360</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2362')\">BDB2362</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>זַכּוּר</bdbheb> <b>proper name, masculine</b> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <grk>Ζακχυρ</grk>, <grk>Ζακχουρ</grk>, etc.: — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> a Reubenite <ref ref=\"Num 13:4\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"13\" vBegin=\"4\" cEnd=\"13\" vEnd=\"4\" onclick=\"bcv(4,13,4)\">Num 13:4</ref> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> a Simeonite <ref ref=\"1Chr 4:26\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(13,4,26)\">1Chr 4:26</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>3.</b> Levites: <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>a.</b> <ref ref=\"1Chr 24:27\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"27\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"27\" onclick=\"bcv(13,24,27)\">1Chr 24:27</ref>. <br>\\&emsp;\\&emsp;<b>b.</b> an Asaphite <ref ref=\"1Chr 25:2\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(13,25,2)\">1Chr 25:2</ref> (<grk>Σακχους</grk>), v<ref ref=\"1Chr 25:10\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(13,25,10)\">1Chr 25:10</ref> (<grk>Ζαχχουθ</grk>), <ref ref=\"N